--Description: Build 2×2 contingency tables for every chromosome-12 variant using East-Asian (EAS) samples as “cases” and all other samples as “controls”, apply Yates’s-corrected χ², keep variants whose four expected counts ≥ 5 and χ² ≥ 29.71679, and return their genomic positions with the statistic.
WITH allele_by_grp AS (
